# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/maipai_music.cc (ours)
# Check after a flash: with music playing for eleven minutes in a room with no host, the dance stops once at about ten minutes (log line 'resting after ten minutes') and starts again after three.
# Kconfig: CONFIG_MAIPAI_MUSIC_DANCE (existing)

